      "title": "Update packet-twamp.c",
      "message": "Update packet-twamp.c\r\nThe Sender Timestamp must use the Sender Error Estimate; with offset 0 it was looking for Error Estimate inside the timestamp, so the result was random. Offset should be +8 to check the Sender Error Estimate.",
